Que pena.

67
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,420
Mirāju Tenpo!

68
00:03:51,820 --> 00:03:54,180
Cuidado com as nuvens de desespero!

69
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:58,860
Dosu Mānosu!

70
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,550
